# =============================================================================
# payway-woocommerce-v2 — superficie pública (producto)
#
# Se versiona:
#   wc-gateway-payway/  LICENSE  README.md  CHANGELOG.md
#   docs/manual/  docs/license.md  docs/compatibility-matrix.md  docs/README.md
#   .vscode/settings.json
#   ci/.gitkeep
